(1. Working Capital Loan Tranches and Tenure:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Under PM SVANidhi, eligible urban street vendors receive a collateral-free first tranche working capital loan of up to Rs. 10,000 with a repayment tenure of 12 months.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Upon timely repayment of the first tranche loan, street vendors become eligible for a second tranche working capital loan of up to Rs. 20,000.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Vendors who repay the second tranche loan on time are eligible for a third tranche working capital loan of up to Rs. 50,000 for business expansion.) Tj
ET
