(2. Interest Subvention and Digital Cashback Incentives:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Street vendors availing working capital loans under PM SVANidhi receive an interest subvention of 7% per annum, which is credited quarterly to the borrower bank account.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(To promote digital payments, street vendors receive a cashback incentive of up to Rs. 1,200 per year \(capped at Rs. 100 per month\) on eligible retail digital transactions.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(3. Eligibility and Exclusions:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Only urban street vendors engaged in vending in urban municipal areas are eligible; corporate retail chains and income tax payers are excluded and not eligible.) Tj
ET
